 "html": "<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(48px,7vw,96px);padding-bottom:clamp(48px,6vw,80px)\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#4C4A66\"><a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#4C4A66\">Home</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/payments\" style=\"color:#4C4A66\">Payments</a><span>/</span><span style=\"color:#3B2ED3\">Mobile money API</span></nav><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px, 2.2vw + 26px, 58px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.045em;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 0;max-width:16ch\">One mobile money API for Africa<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h1><p style=\"font-size:clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px);line-height:1.55;color:#4C4A66;margin:24px 0 0;max-width:58ch\">Pay out to and collect from mobile money wallets across 20 African countries through one integration: M-Pesa, MTN MoMo, Airtel Money, Orange Money, Wave and the other networks each market uses.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px\"><a href=\"/contact\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff\" class=\"dp-1uxoczp\">Talk to sales</a><a href=\"/#platform\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#F6F4EF;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\">See the platform →</a></div><div style=\"margin-top:40px;max-width:760px;padding:22px 24px;border-radius:20px;background:#F6F4EF\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4C4A66\"><span style=\"width:8px;height:8px;background:#5ED6B4\"></span>In short</div><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6\">A mobile money API lets your software send money to, and receive money from, mobile wallets such as M-Pesa and MTN MoMo. ElementPay gives businesses one API and dashboard for mobile money in 20 African countries, funded in local currency, USD or USDC and USDT.</p></div></section>\n<div style=\"background:#F6F4EF\">\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">What businesses use it for.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Payouts to wallets</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Pay suppliers, staff, agents and users straight to their mobile money wallet.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Collections</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Request payment from customers’ wallets and settle into one balance.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Bulk disbursements</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Send hundreds of wallet payouts from one file or API call.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Wallet cash-in and cash-out</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Fintechs and apps move users between their app and mobile money.</p></div></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">How it works.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">01</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px 0 0\">Integrate once</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">One API for every network and country we cover.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#FFB224;color:#131126\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">02</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px 0 0\">Fund your balance</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">In local currency, USD, or USDC and USDT.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#7C6FFF;color:#131126\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">03</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px 0 0\">Send or request</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">Choose the network and confirm the amount.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#5ED6B4;color:#131126\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">04</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px 0 0\">Track by webhook</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">Every payment returns a status and your reference.</p></div></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Related.</h2><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px\"><a href=\"/blog/what-is-a-mobile-money-api\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">Guide: What is a mobile money API?</a><a href=\"/mpesa-api-for-business\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">M-Pesa API for business</a><a href=\"/bulk-payouts-africa\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">Bulk payouts</a><a href=\"/collect-payments-in-africa\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">Collect payments in Africa</a><a href=\"/payout-api\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">Payout API</a><a href=\"/coverage\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1hp7yy2\">Coverage</a></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Questions.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:32px;max-width:880px\"><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"padding:22px 24px;font-weight:600;font-size:17px\">Which mobile money networks does ElementPay support?</summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Networks include M-Pesa, MTN MoMo, Airtel Money, Orange Money, Wave, Moov Money, Free Money, Telecel Cash, AT Money, Mixx by Yas, telebirr, Zamtel Kwacha, TNM Mpamba and e-Mola, depending on the country.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"padding:22px 24px;font-weight:600;font-size:17px\">How many countries does the mobile money API cover?</summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">20 African countries across East, West, Central and Southern Africa.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"padding:22px 24px;font-weight:600;font-size:17px\">Can we both pay out and collect?</summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Yes. The same API handles payouts to wallets and collections from wallets.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"padding:22px 24px;font-weight:600;font-size:17px\">Do we need a separate integration per network?</summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">No. One integration covers every network and country we support.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"padding:22px 24px;font-weight:600;font-size:17px\">Who can use it?</summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Verified businesses: fintechs, platforms, payroll providers, merchants and remittance companies.</p></details></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><div style=\"border-radius:28px;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff;padding:clamp(36px,6vw,80px);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-0.045em;font-weight:700;margin:0;max-width:12ch\">Connect to mobile money<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h2><a href=\"/contact\" style=\"padding:16px 28px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#fff;color:#3B2ED3\" class=\"dp-16y87us\">Talk to sales</a></div></section>\n\n</div>"
